You will receive a bonus of up to 10% of the annual salary;
You are entitled to 21.5 vacation days a year including vitality leave. In addition, you will receive 10 days of holidays (part of the Benefit Budget);
You can use the Benefit Budget flexibly based on your preferences. For example, buy additional leave rights or pay out a part of the accumulated budget monthly;
Benefits if you have taken out a health insurance at Silver Cross Achmea;
Excellent pension structure at ABP including an extra safety net for death and disability. A comforting thought;
Stay fit! Free sports at EindhovenGym in our property or tax-friendly settlement of the cost of another gym.
